{
    "background_story": "Bitsy was a sweet, gentle soul who everyone in the family affectionately called 'Gramma'. She spent most of her life on the family farm, where she learned the art of traditional cooking and baking from her own grandmother. Bitsy's kitchen was always filled with the warm, comforting aromas of freshly baked cookies, bread, and pies. Her famous 'Gramma's Gingersnap Cookies' were a staple at every family gathering, and her secret recipe was passed down through generations. Bitsy's love and care for her family were evident in every detail, from the way she carefully selected ingredients to the way she wrapped each cookie in a warm hug. Her family cherished her warmth, wisdom, and of course, her incredible baking skills, which made her the beloved matriarch of the family.",
